          "headline": "Video Restyle Studio",
          "comment": [
            "Restyle a clip without re-shooting or re-animating it.\n\n",
            "Motion, timing and framing come from the source video. Only the look changes.\n\n",
            "Strength is the dial to turn: 0.3-0.5 keeps faces and text legible, 0.7+ commits to the style and will drift."
